      "writtenOn": "2026-09-14T14:54:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "OK, I understand the intention but is it clients role to \"detect a server configuration problem\"? Further, is 409 a good choice for the response code? Why is this a \"conflict\"? Maybe 501 \"not implemented\" or 403 forbidden are better choices?",
      "parentUuid": "59e17531_d0820eed",
      "revId": "e1d85d244d4c5a552b934fb0738e9dc40a6005bd",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2b829c5c_25cd1c5a",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 14,
